WEBVTT

00:26.150 --> 00:29.360
Give me your sword.

02:30.850 --> 02:35.860
<i>Episode 11 Renya Yagyu.</i>

02:55.340 --> 02:57.340
So, this is an ocean, huh?

03:00.180 --> 03:01.520
You've never seen
an ocean before?

03:01.550 --> 03:05.310
Yeah, I grew up in
a mountain village.

03:06.640 --> 03:10.030
Say, I guess there's a land
beyond this ocean, right?

03:10.060 --> 03:12.060
I wonder what
kind of place it is.

03:12.650 --> 03:14.820
Every place is the same.

03:15.650 --> 03:19.790
There is a sky, and there's
ground, and people living there.

03:19.820 --> 03:23.130
Hmph. Don't be such a bore.

03:23.160 --> 03:24.160
Huh?

03:25.160 --> 03:28.290
Hey, Jubei, isn't that
where we're supposed to go?

03:33.920 --> 03:37.270
And where the
hell is that old fart?

03:37.300 --> 03:39.270
What took you so long?

03:39.300 --> 03:40.840
Oh, there he is.

03:42.220 --> 03:43.890
I've been waiting
here for so long.

03:44.470 --> 03:45.230
Are you kidding?

03:45.260 --> 03:47.860
You have no idea what we
had to go through to get here.

03:47.890 --> 03:49.770
You better be grateful
we even made it.

03:51.140 --> 03:53.870
That's fine. I've already
told them about you two.

03:53.900 --> 03:55.900
Get on the ship.

03:56.360 --> 03:59.190
He's so annoying.

04:05.950 --> 04:07.500
Are you all right?

04:07.530 --> 04:09.970
Hey, we were here before you.

04:10.000 --> 04:11.160
Huh!

04:18.460 --> 04:19.880
What was that all about?

04:26.760 --> 04:29.810
We are traveling to Kyushu
with an official mission.

04:34.730 --> 04:36.520
What's wrong, old man?

04:38.230 --> 04:39.440
I know him.

04:41.490 --> 04:44.950
Help! Get me on the ship!

05:15.350 --> 05:17.070
Let me go!

05:17.100 --> 05:19.370
What are you
going to do with me?

05:19.400 --> 05:24.820
Well, I just want to show
you something entertaining.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.700
Have a good look at them!

05:42.170 --> 05:45.800
Those Hiruko bums, the
scum of society, have gathered.

05:58.100 --> 05:59.870
I feel sick.

05:59.900 --> 06:03.040
Already seasick? What a sissy.

06:03.070 --> 06:04.530
Shut up!

06:06.650 --> 06:09.240
You must be Jubei Kibagami.

06:09.950 --> 06:12.300
I would like you to
hand the so-called.

06:12.330 --> 06:15.080
Hiruko treasure that
you possess over to me.

06:15.410 --> 06:17.410
Who are you?

06:18.000 --> 06:20.300
We don't need to
tell you who we are!

06:20.330 --> 06:22.960
Just hand over the Dragon Stone!

06:23.800 --> 06:24.800
No, thanks.

06:25.840 --> 06:28.220
I hate snobs.

06:28.930 --> 06:30.050
I see.

06:30.840 --> 06:32.760
Then we have no choice.

06:40.520 --> 06:42.520
<i>Oh, no.</i>

06:54.990 --> 06:56.240
No!

06:56.870 --> 06:59.160
What's with this kid?

07:01.120 --> 07:04.250
Hell, come on!

07:07.590 --> 07:08.840
Hey!

07:12.260 --> 07:13.890
I guess I have to do this.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.150
What was that all about?

07:56.180 --> 07:57.350
Gotcha!

08:02.980 --> 08:05.160
Wow. I found something cool.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.230
What?

08:08.190 --> 08:09.160
My goodness!

08:09.190 --> 08:10.690
Hey, kid, stop!

08:11.110 --> 08:12.110
Get her!

08:12.740 --> 08:14.210
You little brat!

08:14.240 --> 08:16.500
I'm over here! Come and get me!

08:16.530 --> 08:18.090
She's over there!

08:18.120 --> 08:20.120
Hey, stop!

08:21.750 --> 08:25.210
- Wait!
- Wait up! Get her!

08:28.960 --> 08:31.060
Where did she go?

08:31.090 --> 08:33.550
Come and get me!

08:35.260 --> 08:36.230
You brat!

08:36.260 --> 08:39.470
Stop, you little brat!

08:41.310 --> 08:42.810
Look, look!

08:43.520 --> 08:46.560
- See this? I'm over here!
- Damn you!

08:50.230 --> 08:52.250
Go through here
and get that girl!

08:52.280 --> 08:54.000
Why me?

08:54.030 --> 08:57.490
Just hurry and get
her before they do!

08:58.120 --> 08:59.840
All right, all right, I'll go.

08:59.870 --> 09:03.910
You sure make me
do the dirty work.

09:04.250 --> 09:07.720
You go around that
corner. I'll go this way.

09:07.750 --> 09:09.040
Right.

09:14.260 --> 09:17.470
I'm not going to play hide
and seek with that brat.

09:27.480 --> 09:30.860
<i>You are RenyaYagyu, fight'?</i>

09:32.400 --> 09:35.490
Why are you after
the sacred stone?

09:38.660 --> 09:41.990
What will you do with it?

09:44.700 --> 09:47.890
I feel sick.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.350
Where's that kid?

09:49.380 --> 09:52.050
I lost sight of her.

09:56.590 --> 09:59.520
What a useless bum you are.

09:59.550 --> 10:02.060
Lord! Lord!

10:05.480 --> 10:07.310
What happened?

10:08.940 --> 10:10.900
What's the matter?

10:24.080 --> 10:26.330
Who did this?

10:29.420 --> 10:35.300
It looks like we're not the only
passengers aboard this ship.

11:10.330 --> 11:12.550
Now the show begins.

11:12.580 --> 11:15.040
You should enjoy this immensely.

11:34.860 --> 11:37.500
Why... Why?

11:37.530 --> 11:40.620
It's because you are the
Light Maiden, the royal

11:40.650 --> 11:43.710
princess of the lost
ancient Kingdom of Hiruko.

11:43.740 --> 11:49.790
In order to protect you, those lower-rank
Hirukos will happily die in vain.

11:57.090 --> 12:00.100
Damn. Where did she go?

12:00.130 --> 12:01.550
Such a brat!

12:02.130 --> 12:05.610
She's somewhere on this ship.
Sooner or later, we'll find her.

12:05.640 --> 12:07.220
Come on, let's take a break.

12:11.020 --> 12:13.900
What a disgusting little man.

12:14.520 --> 12:19.080
So, why is Master
Yagyu on board this ship?

12:19.110 --> 12:22.610
They must be after
Shigure as well.

12:24.360 --> 12:26.210
Maybe there's another reason.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.750
Huh?

12:27.780 --> 12:32.290
His face has that
knowing look to it.

12:32.960 --> 12:36.500
As always, you sure
don't miss a thing, huh?

12:44.430 --> 12:46.260
I don't feel good.

12:57.900 --> 13:00.230
Just like the other one.

13:03.780 --> 13:06.160
You might be next.

13:10.330 --> 13:11.330
What's this?

13:29.600 --> 13:31.180
There!

13:57.710 --> 14:02.340
That old woman... where is she?

14:08.180 --> 14:09.640
What?

14:11.010 --> 14:12.010
Whoa!

14:17.480 --> 14:21.610
There she is, the little brat!

14:26.940 --> 14:27.940
What's wrong?

14:29.110 --> 14:33.660
A scary old woman took
my treasure and went away.

14:35.410 --> 14:37.590
What? She took the Dragon Stone?

14:37.620 --> 14:39.080
Oh, my God!

14:40.630 --> 14:43.510
Come on, Jubei!
We've got to find her!

14:43.540 --> 14:44.750
I'll be right along.

14:46.670 --> 14:48.170
It hurts!

14:48.880 --> 14:50.510
You'd better stay still.

14:51.390 --> 14:52.470
Here you go.

14:54.220 --> 14:56.680
How's that? Does it still hurt?

14:58.480 --> 15:01.600
Pain, pain, go away!

15:06.650 --> 15:10.360
Pain, pain, go away!

15:31.050 --> 15:33.720
I got rid of the Hiruko scum.

15:36.310 --> 15:39.390
We can now speed
along and head for Kyushu.

15:47.070 --> 15:51.030
I am so sorry,
everyone. I'm so sorry.

15:51.610 --> 15:54.490
If it weren't for me...

16:08.210 --> 16:10.520
What? Are you still sick?

16:10.550 --> 16:12.470
Shut up.

16:14.140 --> 16:17.260
Why did you bring
the brat with you?

16:20.430 --> 16:22.060
You!

16:23.560 --> 16:26.410
So, did you find that old woman?

16:26.440 --> 16:28.520
Nope.

16:30.690 --> 16:34.070
Hey, Master Yagyu.

16:35.110 --> 16:39.550
What are you guys planning
to do with the Dragon Stone?

16:39.580 --> 16:42.300
Don't waste your breath,
Jubei. He won't say anything.

16:42.330 --> 16:45.260
Even when his men died,
he stayed absolutely quiet.

16:45.290 --> 16:47.050
He's a heartless monster.

16:47.080 --> 16:51.170
Come on, let's find that bitch
and get the Stone back from her.

17:03.140 --> 17:05.650
That girl... could she be?

17:07.100 --> 17:08.610
Ah...

17:09.070 --> 17:13.150
I bet that old bitch has
gotten off the ship by now.

17:14.990 --> 17:16.210
What's the matter?

17:16.240 --> 17:17.910
What happened to that brat?

17:20.200 --> 17:22.130
She must've gotten bored.

17:22.160 --> 17:24.090
She's probably off
playing somewhere.

17:24.120 --> 17:29.380
Well, if she doesn't have the Dragon
Stone anymore, we've got no use for her.

17:42.270 --> 17:44.180
Jubei, come over here!

17:47.270 --> 17:48.400
Whoa!

17:57.530 --> 17:58.530
Damn!

18:01.240 --> 18:02.450
What?!

18:04.250 --> 18:08.620
Jubei! Tsubute! Take
the Stone away from her!

18:09.210 --> 18:11.170
The Stone, the Dragon Stone!

18:20.640 --> 18:22.890
I won't let you have
the Dragon Stone.

18:25.310 --> 18:27.140
That useless bum.

18:34.190 --> 18:35.190
Stop it!

18:57.550 --> 19:00.380
As I suspected.

19:10.230 --> 19:13.560
What? She's a Hiruko.

19:47.930 --> 19:51.640
Pain, pain, go away!

19:55.310 --> 19:58.110
Give me the Stone.

19:59.070 --> 20:00.280
No!

20:01.360 --> 20:04.570
I guess she doesn't like you.

20:04.910 --> 20:09.880
That sacred Stone is a key to the
hidden place of enormous Hiruko treasure.

20:09.910 --> 20:12.830
I can't let you have it.

20:29.770 --> 20:33.350
Don't hurt him!

20:45.240 --> 20:51.330
Pain... pain... go away.

20:55.710 --> 20:57.170
You!

21:19.730 --> 21:23.190
Land! Thank God!

21:47.590 --> 21:52.310
Wow! I'm on land, I'm on land!

23:29.780 --> 23:31.740
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:32.450 --> 23:34.670
The Kimon head for a volcano.

23:34.700 --> 23:37.660
Within lie the ruins of a dream.

23:38.250 --> 23:41.120
Jubei arrives to rescue Shigure.

23:41.580 --> 23:44.260
Rounding out the
danger is Renya,

23:44.290 --> 23:47.630
as well as the spirits of
drowned Hiruko ninjas.

23:47.960 --> 23:52.680
The final battle begins, in a grand
brawl where no outcome is certain.

23:53.180 --> 23:56.780
Next time on Ninja Scroll:
Dynasty Restoration.

23:56.810 --> 23:57.990
<i>Episode 12 Dynasty
Restoration Witness.</i>

23:58.020 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 12 Dynasty Restoration</i>
